          "language": "md",
          "contents": "For loop\n\nSTART workout\n  SET pushups TO 0\n  SET goal TO 10\n\n  WHILE pushups IS LESS THAN goal\n    DO a push up\n    INCREASE pushups BY 1\n  END WHILE\n\nFINISH workout\n\n\nWhile loop\n\nSTART game\n  SET makeBasket TO false\n\n  WHILE makeBasket IS FALSE\n    RUN shootBasket function\n  END WHILE\n\nFINISH game",
